OL,3,AHundreds of flights cancelled as
OL,4,ATyphoon Champi shuts Taiwan
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of flights in the East Asia
OL,7,Fregion were cancelled on Friday as
OL,8,Fpowerful Typhoon Champi roared close to
OL,9,FTaiwan's north-east coast.
OL,11,FSchools and offices in Taiwan were shut
OL,12,Fas Champi neared the island. While it
OL,13,Fis uncertain if it will make landfall,
OL,14,Fthe storm was forecast to bring 90cm
OL,15,F(35in) of rain and strong winds to the
OL,16,Fnorth-east until Saturday.
OL,18,FOne person died after being swept away
OL,19,Fby waves, authorities said. The storm
OL,20,Falso injured 171 people and forced
OL,21,F1,000 others to evacuate.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
